Summary
-------

Applications written in Gorbi may be distributed under any license,
including proprietary and commercial licenses, provided that such
applications are not themselves derived from Gorbi compiler,
toolchain, runtime, or standard library source code.

Modifications to the Gorbi Compiler and Toolchain remain subject
to the GPLv3.

Modifications to the Gorbi Runtime Library and Standard Library
remain subject to the GPLv3 except as permitted by the Runtime
Library Exception.